# smart-delete — шаги записи (что показывается — smart-delete.md)
# Этап 1 — умолчание: обе клавиши выключены, Delete — обычный Obsidian.
open Errands.md
caret - Call the plumber
say Default: Delete pulls up the indent and the bullet too
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Call the plumber    - about the kitchen sink / - Book a table

say Smart Delete → on
settings Keyboard
set Smart Delete = on
caret - Book a table
say Delete at the end → only the words come up
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Book a table for Friday evening / - Buy stamps

say Smart Backspace → on
settings Keyboard
set Smart Backspace = on
caret - and envelopes @ and
say Backspace at the start → the words go up
key Backspace
expect ## To do / - Book a table / - Buy stamps and envelopes

say Drop the line Prefix → off
settings Keyboard
set Drop the line Prefix = off
caret - Call the plumber
say Delete → the bullet comes along, the indent does not
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Call the plumber - about the kitchen sink / - Book a table
